---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="OJ Raqueño — .NET, full-stack, and software design writing."
>
  <article class="section prose">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">
      I help businesses ship modern, usable software — and I write about the design
      decisions along the way.
    </p>
    <ul class="focus-list">
      <li>.NET backends</li>
      <li>Full-stack delivery</li>
      <li>Architecture tradeoffs</li>
      <li>Azure as a developer</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      This site replaces my older Blogger archive (OJ Develops) so posts and companion
      GitHub repos live in one place that works as a portfolio.
    </p>
    <p>
      Expect writing on .NET backends, full-stack delivery, architecture tradeoffs,
      Azure as a developer (not as an admin specialty), and how AI changes the way
      we build without replacing engineering judgment.
    </p>
    <p>
      Find me on
      <a href="https://github.com/ojraqueno" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
      and
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ojraqueno/" rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >LinkedIn</a
      >.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
